    {
      "id": "en.n5.class-32.t04",
      "en": "Her mother will make her tidy her room every Friday.",
      "es": "Su madre la hará ordenar su cuarto cada viernes.",
      "explanationEs": "Make + persona + verbo base: obligar, la persona no elige.",
